{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WOODLINS is a relaxing idle game about collecting\u00a0a variety of woodland-inspired creatures that accompanies you during your daily life, whether you're relaxing, studying, working, streaming, or even playing other games! Discover new <strong>Woodlins</strong>, build them a <strong>beautiful home</strong>, <strong>interact</strong> with them, or leave them to hop around and earn coins\u00a0<strong>while you do other things</strong>, all tucked away at the <strong>edge of your screen</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574080/extras/Gif_ScreenPositions-ezgif.com.gif?t=1747982437\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a small set of Woodlins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a small set of items &amp; buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Woodlins with some accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your Woodlins hang out at the top/bottom of your screen or in full-screen, vertical mode is only in the full game :)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable day-night cycle and weather!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo has no end but you only have the starting area to build in, more space can be unlocked in the full game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Please note - progress made in the demo won't carry over to the full game!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574080?t=1747982437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574080?t=1747982437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574080/364174df0aa4e03257c5cba6701a282124ba6c26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747982437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akama